    Faith is not just saying what God has said, it is the preparedness to do what God has said.
    Faith to receive is a combination of your persuation about God's ability plus clearly defined expectations plus your willingness to obey God completely.
    If your are meditating on the faithfulness of God, you are building faith to believe God. If you are meditating on the conditions and the doing grace, you are building the faith to receive. You need both.

